=== judgement notes ===
The round-2 briefing's wrap-rung premise was tested at 4767 / 4837 / 4881 / 4910 / 4937 and is
bridge-only. The hub rows never wrap; the floor is a marked truncation. Round 1's reading of this
surface was correct and is still correct on the final bytes.

Source-side, derived here: 5 of the 9 keys have no live consumer. settings_io.py imports the key
module once (line 72) and calls only agents_* (5126, 5130, 5131, 5133). The teams row takes its
label, choices and help from wire.settings.hub_auto_update_teams_* (5137-5143). teams.* and
model_default.note are catalogue entries no surface renders today, so round 1's teams.label width
fix was cosmetic. Not a defect in the Spanish copy.

